    "url": "https://codersite.dev/tools/claude-md-templates/",
    "title": "CLAUDE.md and AGENTS.md Templates",
    "body": "Ready-made instruction files for AI coding agents such as Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and GitHub Copilot. Copy a template into the root of your repository, or open it in the CLAUDE. md and AGENTS. md Generator to change the commands and rules.           CLAUDE. md Template for Spring Boot:     A ready-to-use CLAUDE. md for Spring Boot REST APIs: Maven commands, layered architecture, constructor injection, records for DTOs and Testcontainers. Copy it or customize it.     View template &rarr;            AGENTS. md Template for Spring Boot with Hexagonal Architecture:     An AGENTS. md for Spring Boot with hexagonal (ports and adapters) architecture and Gradle: a framework-free domain, use cases with ports, adapters, and test-first rules for your AI coding agent.     View template &rarr;            AGENTS. md Template for Spring Boot Microservices:     An AGENTS. md for Spring Boot microservices: each service owns its data, backward-compatible API changes, timeouts on every call, and contract-first OpenAPI rules for AI coding agents.     View template &rarr;            AGENTS. md Template for Next. js (App Router):     An AGENTS. md for Next. js with the App Router and TypeScript: Server Components by default, strict types, Tailwind CSS, Vitest and Playwright rules for your AI coding agent.     View template &rarr;            CLAUDE. md Template for Python and FastAPI:     A CLAUDE. md for Python FastAPI projects with uv, Ruff and pytest: type hints, Pydantic models, async rules, Alembic migrations and dependency injection with Depends.     View template &rarr;            AGENTS. md Template for Go:     An AGENTS. md for Go services: gofmt and go vet, error wrapping with %w, context as the first parameter, small interfaces, table-driven tests and a cmd/internal layout for AI coding agents.     View template &rarr;            CLAUDE. md Template for Domain-Driven Design with Spring Boot:     A CLAUDE. md for Spring Boot projects built with Domain-Driven Design: bounded contexts, aggregates, value objects, domain events and test-first rules for your AI coding agent.     View template &rarr;            AGENTS. md Template for Event-Driven Spring Boot with Kafka:     An AGENTS. md for event-driven Spring Boot services with Kafka: idempotent consumers, versioned events, the transactional outbox, dead-letter topics and message keys for AI coding agents.     View template &rarr;            CLAUDE. md Template for Python AI Apps (LLM and RAG):     A CLAUDE. md for Python LLM and RAG applications: prompts under version control, validated model output, timeouts and retries, prompt injection rules, evaluation sets and mocked models in tests.     View template &rarr;            Cursor Rules Template for Spring Boot (. cursor/rules):     A ready-to-use Cursor rules file for Spring Boot in the . mdc format: front matter, alwaysApply, path-scoped rules with globs, and how to migrate from the old . cursorrules file.     View template &rarr;      Books for Developers Who Work with AI Agents: A template gets your agent started. These books explain what happens behind it: how models read your instructions, and how to build AI features and agents of your own.    Prompt Engineering for LLMsHow a model reads its context, and how to write instructions it follows.      AI EngineeringFrom choosing a model to evaluating, RAG and cost: AI features in production.      Building Applications with AI AgentsPlanning, tools, memory and multi-agent systems you can rely on.   "
